    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17516" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄϋπν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sleepless, wakeful,</i> of
			persons, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.404
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.591
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.4.26
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος, τῶν στρατηγῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					72.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν ἀΰπνους ἄγρας,</span>
			of fishermen, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				880
			</span></i>; of the eye, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄϋπνά τ᾽ ὀμμάτων τέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1137
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>sleepless, never-resting,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πηδάλια</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				206
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					685
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					423
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sannyr.
					2
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of nights, <i>sleepless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰς μὲν ἀΰπνους νύκτας ἴαυον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.325
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.340
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνος ἄ.</span> a sleep
				<i>that is no sleep, from which one easily awakes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				848
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
